Node Health Checklist
kubectl get nodes

Look for:

Ready
NotReady
SchedulingDisabled

Inspect node:

kubectl describe node node01

Review:

Conditions
Capacity
Allocatable
Taints
Labels
Events

Then verify host health:

uptime
free -h
df -h
ip addr

Where GPU utilities are available:

nvidia-smi

The objective is to determine whether the failure belongs to:

Kubernetes
Operating System
GPU
Networking
Fabric
Storage
Scheduler
Application
